# Google Maps Platform API key — used server-side only, never sent to the browser.
#
# Powers three serverless functions:
#   /api/drivetimes  → Distance Matrix API  (traffic-aware drive times)
#   /api/places      → Places API           (discover nearby centers / airports)
#   /api/geocode     → Geocoding API         (search-to-add a site by address)
# Enable the "Distance Matrix API", "Places API", and "Geocoding API" on the key.
#
# Production (Vercel): set this in
#   Project → Settings → Environment Variables  (add to all environments),
#   then redeploy.
#
# Local testing: copy this file to `.env` and run `vercel dev` (plain
# `vite dev` does not run the /api function).
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# FBI Crime Data Explorer key — server-side only, used by /api/crime for the
# Crime & safety auto-score (city/agency-level UCR data). Free key from
# https://api.data.gov/signup/ . Optional: without it, crime auto-score is
# skipped and the rest of auto-score still works.
FBI_CRIME_API_KEY=
